Package: smtp2go-helper
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, postfix, ca-certificates
Description: send-only Postfix pipe transport for SMTP2GO API
 Local mail is queued by Postfix and submitted using SMTP2GO's JSON API
 over HTTPS. This package does not configure incoming mail services.
